                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The accompanying spreadsheets provides aggregate statistics of the EKTIS and following surveys with data from 2010 to 2013.\nThe EKTIS was administered by the United Nation University's Maastricht Economic Research Institute on Innovation and Technology (UNU-MERIT) on behalf of the European Commission's DG for Research & Innovation. \nThe EKTIS questionnaire contains questions addressing research activities, intellectual property rights, invention disclosures, patenting, licensing, start-ups, and other related knowledge transfer activities, as well as office staff."
